<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Password Reset</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 24px 12px; background: #f8fafc; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #020617; }
    .shell { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .wrapper { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); padding: 32px 32px 28px; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(3, 105, 161, 0.18); border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.2); color: #e0f2fe; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .header h1 { margin: 18px 0 10px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { margin: 0; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .section-title { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.35; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; }
    .otp-panel { margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #eff6ff 100%); border: 1px solid #bae6fd; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-align: center; }
    .otp-label { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #475569; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .otp-code { margin: 0; color: #0369a1; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.24em; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
    .otp-hint { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .meta { margin: 22px 0; }
    .item { margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .item-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .item-value { color: #0f172a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; }
    .notice { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff7ed; border-left: 4px solid #0369a1; color: #7c2d12; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .notice strong { color: #431407; }
    .footnote { margin: 18px 0 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px 28px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: center; background: #f8fafc; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body { padding: 0; }
      .wrapper { border-radius: 0; }
      .header, .body, .footer { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
      .otp-code { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="eyebrow">Account Recovery</div>
        <h1>Password Reset</h1>
        <p>Verify your account recovery request using the security OTP code issued for this session.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="section-title">Your password reset request has been received</p>
        <p class="lead">If this was you, enter the OTP code below in the {{appName}} app to continue setting a new password.</p>

        <div class="otp-panel">
          <p class="otp-label">One-Time Password</p>
          <p class="otp-code">{{otp}}</p>
          <p class="otp-hint">This code is valid for <strong>{{expiresMinutes}} minutes</strong> and expires after use.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="meta">
          <div class="item">
            <span class="item-label">Request Time</span>
            <span class="item-value">{{requestTime}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="item">
            <span class="item-label">IP Address</span>
            <span class="item-value">{{ip}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="item">
            <span class="item-label">Device</span>
            <span class="item-value">{{userAgentParsed}}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Not you?</strong> You can ignore this email. Your current password will not change until the OTP code is successfully verified.
        </div>

        <p class="footnote">To protect your account, do not share this OTP code with anyone, including support personnel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        This email was sent automatically by {{appName}}. Please do not reply to this email.<br />
        © {{appName}}. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
